This package implements the text architecture published with Kimi K3.

The Kimi K3 configuration, custom modeling code, and KDA mathematics are
referenced from moonshotai/Kimi-K3 revision
301be1b88c89c0d3a763da6301352cb8fe399e90.

The CPU KDA correctness path is derived from the public torch reference in
MoonshotAI/FlashKDA revision d2ff19a6a0c82f39f796f637ebd1c36090b1268f.
The initial CUDA path calls flash-linear-attention's chunk_kda interface.
FlashKDA is a forward-only optional FLA backend and has not been validated for
this package.

